{"seq":10,"slug":"smart-manufacturing","title":"智能制造工程","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/smart-manufacturing","introMarkdown":"# 智能制造工程 简介\n\n智能制造工程是面向新一代工业革命的交叉学科专业，融合了先进制造技术、信息通信技术、人工智能与系统工程等多个领域的核心知识。本课程体系旨在培养能够设计、实施和优化智能制造系统的高素质工程技术人才。\n\n本课程适用于大学智能制造工程专业本科生及相关工程专业研究生，要求具备机械工程基础、编程能力和一定的数学建模素养。\n\n全书分为四章，系统构建智能制造工程的完整知识体系：\n\n第一章**制造科学基础**，聚焦先进制造工艺原理、制造系统建模方法与精密测量质量工程三大主题，为后续学习提供坚实的制造学科根基。\n\n第二章**信息技术集成**，深入探讨工业互联网架构、数字孪生技术与工业大数据分析，揭示信息技术如何赋能传统制造业实现数字化转型。\n\n第三章**智能装备系统**，系统讲解工业机器人应用、数控与增材制造技术以及智能物流系统，展现智能装备在现代工厂中的核心作用。\n\n第四章**系统集成与优化**，从制造执行系统与生产调度出发，延伸至智能工厂整体设计与绿色可持续制造，培养系统级工程思维。\n\n推荐学习路径为：先掌握第一章的制造科学基础理论，再学习第二章信息技术如何与制造深度融合，然后理解第三章智能装备的具体实现，最后通过第四章的系统集成将前三章知识贯通应用。建议结合实验课程和工厂参观，将理论与实践紧密结合。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"manufacturing-science-foundations","title":"制造科学基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/smart-manufacturing/manufacturing-science-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"advanced-manufacturing-processes","title":"先进制造工艺","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/smart-manufacturing/manufacturing-science-foundations/advanced-manufacturing-processes"},{"seq":2,"slug":"manufacturing-system-modeling","title":"制造系统建模","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/smart-manufacturing/manufacturing-science-foundations/manufacturing-system-modeling"},{"seq":3,"slug":"precision-measurement-quality","title":"精密测量与质量工程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/smart-manufacturing/manufacturing-science-foundations/precision-measurement-quality"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"information-technology-integration","title":"信息技术集成","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/smart-manufacturing/information-technology-integration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"industrial-iot-architecture","title":"工业互联网架构","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/smart-manufacturing/information-technology-integration/industrial-iot-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"digital-twin-technology","title":"数字孪生技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/smart-manufacturing/information-technology-integration/digital-twin-technology"},{"seq":3,"slug":"industrial-big-data-analytics","title":"工业大数据分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/smart-manufacturing/information-technology-integration/industrial-big-data-analytics"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"intelligent-equipment-systems","title":"智能装备系统","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/smart-manufacturing/intelligent-equipment-systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"industrial-robotics-applications","title":"工业机器人应用","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/smart-manufacturing/intelligent-equipment-systems/industrial-robotics-applications"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cnc-and-additive-manufacturing","title":"数控与增材制造","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/smart-manufacturing/intelligent-equipment-systems/cnc-and-additive-manufacturing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"intelligent-logistics-systems","title":"智能物流系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/smart-manufacturing/intelligent-equipment-systems/intelligent-logistics-systems"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"system-integration-optimization","title":"系统集成与优化","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/smart-manufacturing/system-integration-optimization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mes-and-production-scheduling","title":"MES 与生产调度","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/smart-manufacturing/system-integration-optimization/mes-and-production-scheduling"},{"seq":2,"slug":"smart-factory-design","title":"智能工厂设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/smart-manufacturing/system-integration-optimization/smart-factory-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"green-sustainable-manufacturing","title":"绿色可持续制造","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/smart-manufacturing/system-integration-optimization/green-sustainable-manufacturing"}]}]}